param([Parameter(Mandatory=$true)][string]$Engine,[Parameter(Mandatory=$true)][ValidatePattern('^[a-f0-9]{64}$')][string]$EngineSha,[ValidatePattern('^[a-z0-9-]+$')][string]$Label='a')
$ErrorActionPreference='Stop';$visProject=[IO.Path]::GetFullPath((Join-Path $PSScriptRoot '../../../..'));$visOut=Join-Path $visProject ('.cache/native-render-gap/original/visibility-cache/fixture-'+$Label);$visManifest=Get-Content -LiteralPath (Join-Path $visOut 'manifest.json') -Raw|ConvertFrom-Json;$visEngine=[IO.Path]::GetFullPath($Engine)
function Assert-VisibilityPins{if((Get-FileHash -LiteralPath $visEngine).Hash.ToLowerInvariant()-ne$EngineSha){throw 'Engine drift'};foreach($visPin in $visManifest.pins){if((Get-FileHash -LiteralPath (Join-Path $visManifest.renderer $visPin.relative)).Hash.ToLowerInvariant()-ne$visPin.sha256){throw 'Frozen fixture drift'}}}
foreach($visMode in @('control','cache')){
 Assert-VisibilityPins;$visRun=Join-Path $visOut $visMode;if(Test-Path -LiteralPath $visRun){throw 'Preserve variant'};New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $visRun|Out-Null
 $visStart=[Diagnostics.ProcessStartInfo]::new();$visStart.FileName=$visEngine;$visStart.UseShellExecute=$false;$visStart.CreateNoWindow=$true;$visStart.RedirectStandardOutput=$true;$visStart.RedirectStandardError=$true
 $visArguments=@('--headless','--rendering-method','dummy','--audio-driver','Dummy','--fixed-fps','1000','--disable-render-loop','--path',$visManifest.renderer,'--script','res://fixture.gd','--',('--report='+(Join-Path $visRun 'native.json')));if($visMode-eq'cache'){$visArguments+='--visibility-chain-cache=epochs'}
 foreach($visArgument in $visArguments){$visStart.ArgumentList.Add($visArgument)};$visStart.Environment['APPDATA']=Join-Path $visRun 'appdata';$visStart.Environment['LOCALAPPDATA']=Join-Path $visRun 'localappdata'
 $visChild=[Diagnostics.Process]::new();$visChild.StartInfo=$visStart;[void]$visChild.Start();@{pid=$visChild.Id;engine=$visEngine;engineSha256=$EngineSha;arguments=$visArguments;startedUtc=[DateTime]::UtcNow.ToString('o')}|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 8|Set-Content -LiteralPath (Join-Path $visRun 'process.json') -Encoding utf8;Write-Output ('Started visibility fixture '+$visMode+' PID '+$visChild.Id)
 $visStdout=$visChild.StandardOutput.ReadToEndAsync();$visStderr=$visChild.StandardError.ReadToEndAsync();if(-not$visChild.WaitForExit(30000)){$visChild.Kill();[void]$visChild.WaitForExit(1000);throw 'Owned headless fixture timed out'}
 $visCode=$visChild.ExitCode;$visOutput=$visStdout.GetAwaiter().GetResult();$visError=$visStderr.GetAwaiter().GetResult();$visChild.Dispose();[IO.File]::WriteAllText((Join-Path $visRun 'stdout.log'),$visOutput);[IO.File]::WriteAllText((Join-Path $visRun 'stderr.log'),$visError);Assert-VisibilityPins
 if($visCode-ne0-or($visOutput+$visError)-match'SCRIPT ERROR|ERROR:|Parse Error|Compile Error|leaked|still in use|CrashHandler'){Get-Content -LiteralPath (Join-Path $visRun 'stderr.log') -Tail 18;throw ('Fixture rejected '+$visMode)}
 $visReport=Get-Content -LiteralPath (Join-Path $visRun 'native.json') -Raw|ConvertFrom-Json;if(-not$visReport.success-or$visReport.failures.Count-ne0-or$visReport.checks-lt1000){throw 'Actual callback predicates failed'}
 @{exit=$visCode;success=$true;checks=$visReport.checks;finishedUtc=[DateTime]::UtcNow.ToString('o')}|ConvertTo-Json|Set-Content -LiteralPath (Join-Path $visRun 'receipt.json') -Encoding utf8
}
$visControl=Get-Content -LiteralPath (Join-Path $visOut 'control/native.json') -Raw|ConvertFrom-Json;$visCache=Get-Content -LiteralPath (Join-Path $visOut 'cache/native.json') -Raw|ConvertFrom-Json
$visControlTruth=[ordered]@{checks=$visControl.checks;observations=$visControl.observations;worker_read=$visControl.worker_read;worker_write=$visControl.worker_write}|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 60 -Compress
$visCacheTruth=[ordered]@{checks=$visCache.checks;observations=$visCache.observations;worker_read=$visCache.worker_read;worker_write=$visCache.worker_write}|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 60 -Compress
if($visControlTruth-cne$visCacheTruth){throw 'Control/cache callback observations differ'}
@{version=1;success=$true;engine=$visEngine;engineSha256=$EngineSha;checksPerVariant=$visCache.checks;observationRows=$visCache.observations.Count;exactObservations=$true;cache=$visCache.cache;scope='Common-engine headless Node3D public state/subclass callbacks and detached worker differential. No GPU/FPS proof.'}|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 8|Set-Content -LiteralPath (Join-Path $visOut 'acceptance.json') -Encoding utf8
Write-Output 'Visibility actual callback differential PASS; both children closed.'
